{"\003Four o’clock\004 has just struck. Good! Arrangement, revision, reading from four to five. Short snooze of restoration for myself, from five to six. Affair of agent and sealed letter from seven to eight. At eight, en route.","The Woman in White - The Story Continued","Walter Hartwright VII",true},
