{"The horrifying R.N. wipes Gately’s face off as best she can with her hand and says she’ll try to fit him in for a sponge bath before she goes off shift at \0031600h.\004, at which Gately goes rigid with dread.","Infinite Jest","David Foster Wallace",true},
