{"\003Four forty\004 P.M. Besta sang another hymn. Everyone knew something was wrong. How long did they wait? The mayor was going crazy inside, as was the mayor’s wife, as was their daughter. Seiji could barely contain his rage. He was turning as red as his red tuxedo.","Trouble & Triumph: A Novel of Power & Beauty","Tip “T.I.” Harris with David Ritz",true},
