{"At \003six minutes before five\004 o’clock, Daisy Robinson, about to reach her own apartment door, paused to look and to listen. Something was out of order. Tess Rogan’s door was standing wide open and, from within, Daisy could hear something being broken.","The Seventeen Widows of Sans Souci","Charlotte Armstrong",true},
