{"Prager was in his bedroom practicing “Steamy Night on a Steamboat” when his dad knocked on the door. Prager had lost track of time; it was \0034:56\004.\n“She’s here,” Eli said, smiling. “Come out and say hi.”","Kitchens of the Great Midwest","J. Ryan Stradal",true},
